        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgwa kwa Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī yenīyo, nūmona malaika ūngī wa būdūla būtaale alika kūfuma ng'wigūlū; ī likūjo lyakwe lyūyakīīla ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhamuka n'ilaka lya nguzu alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama niigwa ilaka līngī kūfuma ng'wigūlū līlīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A batemi ba mu sī abo baalijingīlaga nang'hwe na kūyegela mu būdooshi bokwe, bakūlībona ī lyochi lya kūpemva kwakwe bandye kūtūla ng'hūngū bakūnīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūbogoha ū būluhiwa bokwe, bakwīmīīla kūle balīlīla būhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na a basūlūja ba mu sī bakūmpīnīhalīla bandye kūnīla, nguno atīho ūngī wa kūbagūlīla ī miligo ya shikolo shabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "miligo ya zahabu na feza na mawe ga mpango ntaale na luulu, na myenda ya kitaani yawiza, na ya nzulunge na ya halili, na yaza; na mitī ya būlī mbika na shikolo sha kūbeejiwa kūfuma mu mapembe ga mhūlī, na sha mitī ya gembe, na sha chūma shibbūpu, na shisīnza, na sha mawe gape; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na shisanjo sha mu shilīwa na maguta ga kwibila, na malaashi, na mvinya na maguta ga kūzugīla shilīwa, na būsu na būsīga, na ng'ombe na ng'holo na falasa na magogoteni, na mibīlī ya banhū, nū būpanga wabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūnīla balīhaya gīkī, ‘Nī litwajo īlo būpanga wako walūlīhahaalīlaga lyakwīngaga; pyī nī shikolo ī shose ī shawiza na sha mpango ntaale shakūkenaagūkīlaga, shitalabonwa hangī na hado yaya!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basūlūja ba shikolo shenīshi abo walī wabasabya, bakwikīga kūle bakūdetemaga, bagogohaga a makoye ayo gangwīlaga. Bakūlījiwa būpīna ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na hangī būlī ntaale wa meli na būlī ng'wene ūyo akashimīzīlaga mu meli, pye a batūmami ba mu meli, abo milīmo yabo īlī mu nyanza, bakwikīga kūle ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakūlīlaga ūlū būlībona ī lyochi lya kūpemva kwa nzengo gwenūyo; bakūlīla balīhaya, ‘Nzengo kī hangī ūyo gūshikile kūlenganījiwa nū nzengo ū ntaale ūyū!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama bakwandya kwisaamagūlīla lūbuubu ū kū mitwe yabo, kūnū balīlīla ng'hūngū kūlwa būpīna būtaale; balīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna malaika wa nguzu ūsola iwe itaale gītī lya kūshela, ūlīponeja mu nyanza kūnū alīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
